and she does not like hostility.\n\nI will leave the composition and situation to you.\nHowever, if you need some ideas, please refer to the following texts\nSleeping curled up on grass or a futon chair.\nLooking into the distance from a high place (chimney, etc.)\nSmiling while being petted by something\nFlying in the air as if he/she feels good.\nBathing in the water\nDripping milk from his fingertips into a bottle\nSnoozing with an animal\nSleeps with a sleeping person and gently drains his energy (luminescence).\nSitting on or embracing a crescent moon, or entangling the moon\nThe animal seems to feel comfortable having its hair sheared by a third party.\nBroken horns (not painful)\nSquatting and peering at small objects\nWalks around at night holding hands with someone.\nSits on a stuffed sheep and looks at the sky\n\nSetting Ability\nMeh is a kind of fairy or demon that lives in people's memories.\nThe edges of her body are faintly luminous, and she is usually floating.\nShe is close to peaches, alcohol, milk, dried bedding, etc.\nShe wears a light sweet fragrance that can throw off a person's guard.\n\nIt induces drowsiness in the person who keeps touching its skin by hugging, etc., and makes them dream.\nIt interferes with the dream and keeps its presence by slipping information about itself into the dream.\nThe body fluid and blood secreted are like condensed milk and milk,\nThe fluid and blood secreted are like condensed milk or milk, tonic and mildly addictive to the person to whom they are given.\n\nPlease refer to the following URL and Skeb's previous deliveries\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/99333545\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/70796264", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@laura097/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3126230, "client_id": 1285057, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https:/