e you will draw our child \"Meyva\".\n\nReference materials\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1qgFL198KMzHOrgOGzZg_oVBpOBUshHe_?usp=share_link\nIf you can't see the URL, please refer to my fixed tweets.\n\n■Theme\nThe theme of the illustration is \"That's not right!\" Please use the following theme.\nI leave the interpretation of the theme to the creator's judgment.\nBy the way, I love the work Danganronpa.\nComposition\nPlease be aware of cut-ins.\nWorldview\nThe world in which Meyva lives is an Earth where civilization has collapsed and thousands of years have passed. The majority of the people who live there are wild animals and robots, except for Mayva, and only a few monsters roam the streets. Most of the places that used to be cities are in ruins for various reasons: submergence, greening, desertification, etc. In rare cases, there are places that have been transformed into shapes that clearly defy physics. Mayva is happily strolling through such a world.\n■Settings (Clothing)\nShe wears an exploration outfit when she explores, but when she judges that there is no danger, or when she is not exploring, she wears a one-piece dress (changing clothes is possible in an instant thanks to future technology).\nOthers\nWe would like to be able to turn on/off the address in the psd layer if possible.\nThe image color of Meiva is \"emerald green\".\nWe would like to use your illustrations for our activities, such as posting them on SNS (e.g. CrossFolio) and introducing them as thumbnails or in videos when we have a chance to post videos in the future.\nWe also have a hashtag \"#Meiva's Record Book,\" which you can refer to here.\n\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1078629, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "SAE", "screen_name": "SAE1293", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/